      <title>Mercado Bitcoin Says It Will Absorb $40 Million Loss From Hack</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-02/mercado-bitcoin-says-it-will-absorb-40-million-loss-from-hack</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">06290460ff35ab19ca85fa72</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 15:43:22 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Brazilian crypto broker Mercado Bitcoin said it would absorb a $40 million loss and that no customer losses were expected after a hack on Monday, the latest in a series of attacks on digital-asset platforms.</description>
