      <title>Frantic Binance Hackers Created Windfall for Fast Crypto Traders</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-02/frantic-binance-hackers-created-windfall-for-fast-crypto-traders</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">3f99bec022c02ee51aba964a</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 12:11:03 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>For most crypto investors, the theft of $6.3 billion from Binance was a reminder of the risks that still surround digital assets. For a small group of fast-moving trading firms and skilled investors, it was a chance to make a quick buck.</description>
